   "subject": "using deployApp with a an app created with shinyApp",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Is is possible to use deployApp() with an app created by shinyApp? It isn&#39;t working, and I wondered if there might be a workaround.</div><div><br></div><div> I am building a package (see <a href=\"https://github.com/tomliptrot/predictshine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/tomliptrot/predictshine&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363298643000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JfdzyhSol0w549zHybtws\">https://github.com/tomliptrot/predictshine</a>) that makes shiny apps using the shinyApp function and I want to be able to deploy these apps.</div><div><br></div><div>see below:</div><div><br></div><div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"> test_app </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      numericInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      plotOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plot&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      output$plot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">head</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cars</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>shinyapps</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">deployApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> test_app</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>Error in shinyapps::deployApp(test_app) : </div><div>  appDir must be a single element character vector</div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div><div><br></div><div>Tom</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
