     "<div dir=\"ltr\">deployApp operates off of a directory.  I bet you could write the app out to a file in a directory and deploy the application from that directory.<div><br><div>-Tareef</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
