rver </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      output$plot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">head</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cars</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>shinyapps</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">deployApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> test_app</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>Error in shinyapps::deployApp(test_app) : </div><div>  appDir must be a single element character vector</div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div>Tom</div></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
